<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Comalco sees firmer aluminium in 97.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Comalco sees firmer aluminium in 97.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aluminium producer Comalco Ltd said on Monday that it expected world aluminium prices to firm and the metal's premium to recover in calendar 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;The outlook is for prices to firm and premiums, which are currently US$20 to US$30 a tonne higher than late last year, they are expected to improve also,&quot; chief executive Terry Palmer told a news conference after the release of annual results.</p>
</text>
